  "summary": "Malicious code in @ornikar/jest-config-react-native-web (npm)",
  "details": "The package @ornikar/jest-config-react-native-web@12.0.8 is a trojanized version of a legitimate jest configuration package. The preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases and executes a 727KB obfuscated Bun-compiled payload (math_init.js) at install time. The package's main entry point (jest-preset.js) simply throws an error telling users to use a different package, meaning the only purpose of installing this version is to execute the preinstall payload.",
